// bridge_grid.lay -- 7 cols x 3 rows
// Classic bridge: rover starts in the middle row one step east of a
// safe +1 exit, with a much more valuable +10 exit six steps east.
// The corridor is flanked above and below by -100 craters so the
// rover cannot stray off the bridge without mission failure.
# -100 -100 -100 -100 -100 #
1 S _ _ _ _ 10
# -100 -100 -100 -100 -100 #
